#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/kde/kf-apps/kdenlive.xml:28
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The <application>Kdenlive</application> package is a KDE Frameworks-based "
"video editor that can handle numerous video and audio codecs."
